    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Moving it",
      "text": [
        "Break the drum and the dropped item keeps the water in its tank. Pair a Tide Pump if you need the water to move on after it arrives: relays and the Tide Pump move fluid, they are not storage.",
        "A [Spring Calling](spring_calling) on a nearby Spirit Cistern is how the water refills itself.",
        "A redstone signal pauses it, and a paused drum takes no water. A dry drum only ever gets the beside-water tier. Crouch and right-click it with this book to see which tier it is on and what is in the tank.",
        "Drums are the [Rootbinders'](tribe_sprout) craft: the recipe needs a Knotted Root and a Water Seal, and the Rootbinders trade a drum to Friends for Spirit Reeds.",
        "Crouch and right-click a face with an empty hand to step it through Both, Input, Output and Closed, as the [Totem Wrench](camp_kit) does."
      ]
    },
